; Passed to AddonBuilder as -exclude=. Files matching these patterns are left
; out of the final PBO. Comment lines start with ';'.

; Sprite sources for /dayz-build-imageset. Only the packed .paa atlas and
; .imageset under gui/imagesets/ ship; the source PNGs stay out of the PBO.
.gui-sources\*.*
.gui-sources\*\*.*
*\.gui-sources\*

; Workbench project files (dayz.gproj, DayZSetting.xml) are for the editor, not the game
workbench\*.*
*\workbench\*

; Binarization by-products and backups
*.dep
*.log
*.rpt
*.bak

; Source, doc and temp folders at the mod root only, archives, image sources.
; These stay anchored to the root: AddonBuilder matches case-insensitively, so
; an unanchored *\Temp\* would also drop scripts\4_World\Temp\ or data\doc\.
Source\*.*
Temp\*.*
Doc\*.*
*.zip
*.7z
*.psd

; Version control
*\.svn\*
*\.git\*
.svn\*.*
.git\*.*
*.scc

; Nested packed files, editor temp files, signatures and keys
*.pbo
*.ebo
*.biedi
*.bisign
*.bikey
*.biprivatekey
